279
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:25,600
So there's no need.

280
00:14:26,560 --> 00:14:28,100
Picture magic is fun, huh?

281
00:14:28,340 --> 00:14:30,340
It took a little while to get used to.

282
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:33,340
But it's way better than the scribbles I did before.

283
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:39,420
We elves are about to design a totally new world!

284
00:14:41,020 --> 00:14:46,120
And as soon as we get rid of all you ugly humans, we'll have a nice fresh canvas to paint on!

285
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:49,460
Fine, then. Looks like we're gonna have to do this the hard way.

286
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,540
I don't get it.

287
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,940
Where did everybody go?

288
00:14:55,940 --> 00:14:59,060
I need some backup!

289
00:14:59,060 --> 00:15:08,180
Sounds like you're lonely, so I'll play with you.

290
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:11,820
But I have a feeling the game won't go on very long.

291
00:15:12,020 --> 00:15:12,620
You again?

292
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:15,320
I don't understand this. Why are you here?

293
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:18,540
Aw, poor thing. You look so confused.

294
00:15:18,940 --> 00:15:22,720
I may be Fauna, but I'm a much different Fauna than the one you remember.

295
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:26,380
So you're the opponent I wound up with.

296
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:31,480
You may be a filthy royal, but at least your mana is interesting.

297
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:37,420
I'm about to teach you the importance of respecting your elders, you mangy brat!

298
00:15:37,940 --> 00:15:41,080
Despite my adolescent form, I won't be easy prey.

299
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:43,160
No human alive can tame this beast.

300
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:46,500
I heard that you had become a captain.

301
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:50,320
Yet we meet again to fight on opposing sides.

302
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:51,720
How regrettable.

303
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:55,360
You were once a great man, Lord Kaiser.

304
00:15:56,140 --> 00:16:02,660
I suppose there's no reason for you to hold back, seeing as you and I don't actually know one another.

305
00:16:02,660 --> 00:16:07,180
Indeed. I won't hold back. That would be ignoble.

306
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:12,760
And what's more, I know Lord Kaiser is more than capable of putting up a decent fight.

307
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:20,960
He never cared much for the spotlight, so I assume he became the captain of the Purple Orcas for the sake of his squad.

308
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:24,600
His poor wife was terribly worried about him.

309
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:29,400
He's an excellent magic knight, and there are people awaiting his return.

310
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:34,140
So you will surrender him now!

311
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:39,720
Flame Spirit Magic, Salamander Spirit!

312
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:51,760
Ha ha ha! That's quite a powerful spell you have.

313
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:54,040
Sadly, it will never reach me.

314
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:59,340
Lord Kaiser's Vortex Magic allows him to deflect and disperse opposing attacks.

315
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:04,980
That, combined with the Elven magic, makes him impervious to Salamander's power.

316
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:07,640
None of my spells will harm him.

317
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:18,960
He can use the Vortex for offense as well.

318
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:22,100
Even with Monoskin, I'm taking a great deal of damage.

319
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:24,900
And all the while, he's washing my magic away.

320
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:26,760
No!

321
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:33,220
Ha ha ha ha ha!

322
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:38,200
Ha ha ha ha ha!

323
00:17:48,220 --> 00:17:48,780
Ha ha ha ha!

324
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:58,700
I burned you to a crisp and you're still fighting!

325
00:17:59,320 --> 00:18:01,860
Speed, reflexes, and strength!

326
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,320
A worthy foe.

327
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:04,260
Impressive!

328
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,280
For a mere boy!

329
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:07,960
Same goes for you!

330
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:11,820
I never knew of another human that could put up a decent fight!

331
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:22,000
It's been a while since I had this much fun fighting a snot-nosed brat one-on-one!

332
00:18:22,540 --> 00:18:24,200
It takes me back to my youth!

333
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:30,360
He detects magic and blocks it automatically, so my attacks will never touch him!

334
00:18:32,260 --> 00:18:34,600
This unfair advantage...

335
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:37,140
It reminds me of my sister.

336
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:41,240
She's had that wild, audacious spirit all her life.

337
00:18:41,820 --> 00:18:44,680
I idolized her for her strength.

338
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:50,440
That is, until I became frustrated with her devil-may-care attitude.

339
00:18:54,180 --> 00:18:55,440
There you are!

340
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:58,520
I'll get you this time!

341
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:00,580
Come back inside!

342
00:19:01,180 --> 00:19:03,080
It's time for our training with Sister Teresa!

343
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:03,920
Hey!

344
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,680
Just let her go, Fueko.

345
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,520
Mero doesn't need to train with us.

346
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:12,260
She'll become stronger on her own.

347
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:14,240
That's how special she is.

348
00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:21,060
Looking back now, I'm sure I must have been quite jealous of her.

349
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:25,940
What?! I don't believe this!

350
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:29,800
You really have no interest in working with the Crimson Lion Kings.

351
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:31,200
That's right.

352
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,880
But why is that?

353
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:36,880
With amazing abilities like yours, you'd be unstoppable as a magic knight.

354
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:39,660
You could even become the Wizard King someday!

355
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:44,760
After I get my Grimoire tomorrow, I'm setting off to explore the strong magic regions.

356
00:19:45,380 --> 00:19:48,860
Who'd want to waste their time on guard duty and catching petty criminals?

357
00:19:49,380 --> 00:19:50,160
It's foolish.

358
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,720
Foolish?

359
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:55,540
Sister!

360
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:57,620
Hmm?

361
00:19:57,620 --> 00:20:00,620
I want to spar.

362
00:20:01,460 --> 00:20:03,680
One round, both of us giving it our all.

363
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:05,400
Right here and now.

364
00:20:06,340 --> 00:20:06,500
Hmph.

365
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:07,920
Oh, really?

366
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:10,520
At least make it fun for me this time.

367
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:11,800
You're so dull.

368
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:21,000
This momentous fight between the Vermillion family's eldest son and eldest daughter would

369
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:25,480
later come to be regarded as the Tuesday of blood and blagues.

370
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:29,440
That overly serious fool was on fire back then!

371
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:36,420
You're probably the most powerful human in this whole kingdom!

372
00:20:36,420 --> 00:20:42,960
I'm sure if I can defeat you, the rest of the humans will be no trouble at all.

373
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,060
Be gone!

374
00:20:48,940 --> 00:20:51,200
You're mine, human!

375
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:00,640
Not me!

376
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:07,360
She's unorthodox, cavalier, and even somewhat mad!

377
00:21:08,020 --> 00:21:12,020
But everywhere she goes, people clear a path, fearing her bold power!

378
00:21:13,600 --> 00:21:17,280
She's overbearing, unbending, and most of all, boring!

379
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:23,080
But his refined, exceptional strength has earned him the respect and loyalty of all who follow him!

380
00:21:23,360 --> 00:21:24,340
My sister!

381
00:21:24,860 --> 00:21:25,840
My brother!

382
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:28,760
He's worthy of being called the strongest!

383
00:21:30,080 --> 00:21:30,720
Reignition!

384
00:21:30,940 --> 00:21:32,060
Time's two!

385
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:35,660
He erased his magic using Salamander as a decoy.

386
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:40,040
That's how he was able to permeate the vortex and get close enough to hit me!

387
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:46,220
By using willpower to endure my attacks, she conserved enough magic for her next strike.

388
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,560
As my sister's younger brother!

389
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:51,680
As that idiot's older sister!

390
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:54,060
I must prevail!

391
00:21:54,060 --> 00:21:56,900
I have to be strong!

392
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:01,860
I have to be strong!

393
00:22:01,860 --> 00:22:03,860
Oh

394
00:22:31,860 --> 00:23:01,840
Thank you.

395
00:23:01,860 --> 00:23:31,840
Thank you.

396
00:23:31,860 --> 00:24:01,840
Thank you.

